    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113235" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰμαί-δρῡς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠος</span>,
